KNOWNBUG: [temp.inst]/2 + [temp.mem.func] -- an out-of-line-defined member
function template with a parameter pack (arity >= 2) loses its body when
instantiated ("no body for callee"): the out-of-line definition is not
attached to the instantiated declarator.  Minimal form of the residual
map/emplace blocker (cpp20_map_basic, cpp11_map_insert).  g++/clang++
runtime-verified.  Flip to CORE once the definition is attached and converted.
